ech":"none","language":"pl","names":"none","part of speech":"ADP","personal data":"none","postal addresses":"none","source":"fineweb-2","toxicity":"none"},"text":"Kremy do biustu podczas karmienia piersią: jaki krem na pękające brodawki\nPoczątki karmienia piersią to sprawdzian dla piersi. Często nie udaje się uniknąć pęknięć brodawek sutkowych i pogryzienia ich przez dziecko. Ale są kremy i maści, które pomogą szybko i skutecznie wyleczyć poranione brodawki. Jakie kremy do biustu stosować podczas karmienia piersią?\nPodczas karmienia piersią, szczególnie na początku, pojawiają się kłopoty związane z pękającymi brodawkami. Piersi bolą podczas karmienia, podpowiadamy jaki wybrać krem na pękające brodawki. Bardzo dobrą, naturalną „maścią” na poranione brodawki sutkowe jest twoje własne mleko, które ma właściwości bakteriobójcze. Dlatego po karmieniu dobrze jest pozostawić kilka kropli mleka na sutku aż do wyschnięcia.\nKremy do biustu: jak działają?\nWarto korzystać także z dostępnych na rynku specjalnych kremów dla kobiet karmiących piersią, zwłaszcza że po wyschnięciu mleka skóra brodawek może być zanadto sucha i spierzchnięta. Taki preparat na pękające brodawki doskonale nawilży, natłuści, otuli kojąco-ochronną warstwą na dłużej, a przede wszystkim przyspieszy gojenie się pęknięć i ranek.\nKremy do biustu: jakie składniki powinny zawierać?\nNajczęściej podstawowym składnikiem maści i kremów do biustu jest lanolina. Substancja ta otrzymywana jest z wydzieliny gruczołów łojowych owiec i po oczyszczeniu skutecznie pielęgnuje skórę piersi, wspomagając procesy regeneracji i gojenia. Inne składniki kremów na pękające brodawki to m.in.: masło shea, wosk pszczeli, olej kokosowy, pantenol, wyciągi z nagietka czy rumianku. Takim preparatem należy smarować poranione brodawki kilka razy dziennie.\nKremy do biustu: zmywać czy nie?\nWiększości z nich nie trzeba nawet zmywać z piersi, przystawiając do niej dziecko – lanolina jest bowiem bezsmakowa, a takie kremy przygotowuje się najczęściej bez sztucznych dodatków, które mogą zaszkodzić dziecku. Zawsze trzeba jednak przeczytać ulotkę dołączoną do opakowania. U około 2 proc. ludzi lanolina może wywoływać alergię – dla takich mam i maluszków przeznaczone są preparaty bez lanoliny. Aby ułatwić ci wybór, przygotowaliśmy zestawienie z dokładnym opisem dostępnych na rynku kremów i maści tego rodzaju. Obejrzyj galerię zdjęć: wybraliśmy kilka dostępnych w sprzedaży kremów","tokens":["K","rem","y"," do"," bi","ust","u"," pod","cz","as"," k","arm","ien","ia"," p","iers","i","ą",":"," j","aki"," k","rem"," na"," p","ę","k","ają","ce"," bro","d","aw","ki","\n","P","oc","zą","t","ki"," k","arm","ien","ia"," p","iers","i","ą"," to"," spraw","dz","ian"," d","la"," p","iers","i","."," C","z","ę","sto"," nie"," ud","aje"," się"," un","ik","n","ą","ć"," p","ę","kn","i","ę","ć"," bro","da","we","k"," sut","kow","ych"," i"," p","og","ry","z","ien","ia"," ich"," pr","zez"," d","zie","cko","."," Ale"," s","ą"," k","rem","y"," i"," ma","ści",","," któ","re"," pom","og","ą"," s","zy","b","ko"," i"," sk","ut","ec","z","nie"," w","yle","c","zy","ć"," por","an","ione"," bro","d","aw","ki","."," Jak","ie"," k","rem","y"," do"," bi","ust","u"," st","os","owa","ć"," pod","cz","as"," k","arm","ien","ia"," p","iers","i","ą","?","\n","Pod","cz","as"," k","arm","ien","ia"," p","iers","i","ą",","," sz","cz","eg","ó","ln","ie"," na"," p","oc","zą","t","ku",","," po","j","aw","ia","j","ą"," się"," k","ł","opot","y"," z","wi","ą","z","ane"," z"," p","ę","k","ają","cy","mi"," bro","d","awk","ami","."," P","iers","i"," bol","ą"," pod","cz","as"," k","arm","ien","ia",","," pod","pow","i","ad","amy"," j","aki"," wy","bra","ć"," k","rem"," na"," p","ę","k","ają","ce"," bro","d","aw","ki","."," Bard","zo"," do","br","ą",","," natural","n","ą"," „","ma","ści","ą","”"," na"," por","an","ione"," bro","d","aw","ki"," sut","k","owe"," jest"," two","je"," w","ł","as","ne"," m","le","ko",","," któ","re"," ma"," w","ła","ści","wo","ści"," ba